cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SpreadEx
message: >-
  If you use SpreadEx in academic work, please cite the ICST 2026 paper below.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/spreadex/spreadex"
abstract: >-
  A local-first harness that runs multiple grammar-based generators against a
  system under test and uses a finite budget to decide which generators and
  which generated inputs deserve execution.
keywords:
  - fuzzing
  - grammar-based testing
  - test prioritization
  - compiler testing
preferred-citation:
  type: conference-paper
  title: >-
    Embedding-based Diversity Mapping for Test Generator Selection and Input
    Prioritization in Grammar-based Testing
  year: 2026
  collection-title: >-
    Proceedings of the IEEE International Conference on Software Testing,
    Verification and Validation (ICST)
